        {
          "kicker": "Recruitment push",
          "heading": "Fiji Rugby confirms interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Earlier this month Fiji Rugby confirmed interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for the 2027 World Cup, and Les Kiss has also weighed in on the move. The move comes as Jake White takes charge as head coach, chosen from 31 applicants. Fiji are in Pool C at the tournament with Argentina, Canada and Spain, and the World Cup in Australia is only a year away."
