      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "edition": "Wednesday 21 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Club form",
          "heading": "Dan Robson calls Bordeaux's France star 'ridiculous' after Gloucester draw",
          "body": "Gloucester's Dan Robson told Planet Rugby that the 36-36 draw with Bordeaux-Bègles left the huddle feeling disappointed, and that last season's Gloucester \"potentially\" wouldn't have drawn with them. He called his opposite number's 803 kicking metres \"ridiculous\". Robson had a season at Pau in the Top 14 before returning to England, and he said the Bordeaux game felt \"a bit more familiar\" for him."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "All Blacks beat Wallabies 43-21",
          "body": "Steve Tandy names 39-man Wales squad."
        }
      ],
