          "kicker": "Winless start",
          "heading": "Italy have no wins from three after 10-57 defeat to Australia",
          "body": "Italy's 10-57 loss to Australia in Round three leaves them with no wins from three matches. Across those three, they have scored 37 points and conceded 131, a difference of -94. Round four brings South Africa, the reigning world champions, who beat Italy 32-14 at home in November 2025 and are next on the fixture list."
        },
