    "390": {
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "edition": "Wednesday 21 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Women's team news",
          "heading": "Scotland women's Aicha Sutcliffe makes first start in Canberra against Australia",
          "body": "Scotland women's interim head coach Dave Butcher has made Aicha Sutcliffe's first Scotland start one of three changes for the final WXV Global Series match against Australia in Canberra. The Glasgow hooker already has six caps off the bench. Sarah Bonar returns in the second row after missing the 56-12 defeat in Sydney through illness, while Chloe Rollie is back at full-back. Hannah Ramsay moves to fly-half and Helen Nelson to inside centre."
        },
        {
